      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "In the \"Proven Impact\" section, emphasize the significant strides taken in previous projects, highlighting any unexpected successes or improvements. Acknowledge the 5% coral health increase as an initial milestone within a larger plan that demonstrates a strong and comprehensive understanding of contributory factors. Clearly outline the next steps and strategies that will lead to the targeted 20%, conveying confidence in OPI's ability to achieve and even surpass this goal. Remember to back your plan with robust scientific insights and realistic timelines to showcase both expertise and reliability.",
